\"list-bullet2\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZsWIdfkIWowo6sxuFTilQomQgTd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Classroom</strong> biến th&agrave;nh <strong>recording studio</strong></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Tn3ldk8gAomagExGr0ylLoWLgPg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Meeting room</strong> giữ nguy&ecirc;n</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OBZrdWFx8oyMr3xam37llchNgqh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Borrowing and returning desk</strong> chia th&agrave;nh 2 khu ri&ecirc;ng</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HKUodfK9xogC0MxTp2Wlp70ng9f\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QcskdIE6RoFckExwCkClFQLsglf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SjJidtvHzoVw26xgHLelWsLcg1b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VC1Hdop0Fo42olxIok2lHlrrgZf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EV7DdZTCUoH4NOxlyjKlEV7OgWb\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2</strong><strong>: C&aacute;c thay đổi ở ph&iacute;a Đ&ocirc;ng v&agrave; khu vực trung t&acirc;m</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XPe4dBDO4o1NERxuTiNlv29xgHX\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 2 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-D6F7dbhjzoFnhUxWTqhljhZ2g9d\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>M&ocirc; tả thư viện 5 năm trước:</strong></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet2\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YyuRdP0w4oliTRxLX40ljVwcgEc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>C&oacute; <strong>library office, desks for computers, studying tables</strong></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YvAZdaHMVoeq5CxsDlolZwpfgHd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả thay đổi t&iacute;nh đến thời điểm hiện tại:</strong></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet2\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRL3dvsc2oUBD3xydjqlg0Scgqh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Library office</strong> được thay thế bởi <strong>conference room </strong></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HxN8dwQXUoddxDxX0pfl9Ax5gud\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Desks for computers </strong>biến th&agrave;nh <strong>desks for students' laptops</strong></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HYiEd3fIOoSF9xxmd4HlXetBgBc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Studying tables </strong>biến th&agrave;nh <strong>private studying tables</strong></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LLmCd5CPSoW10CxjzKFlBOTVgRc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>C&oacute; th&ecirc;m <strong>desks for students' laptops</strong></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>",
