            "name": "Overview",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LqFpdhe2IoPtTTxJkhClIWO4gUh\">Overall, the library has undergone significant modifications over the five-year period, with the most notable change being the modernization of study spaces. Another substantial change can be seen in the reorganization of functional areas, with several spaces being divided or repurposed for more specialized uses.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13834,
